"""Maintain a single, evidence-qualified research line on the homepage and methods."""
from pathlib import Path
import html,re
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
def b(en,zh):return '<span data-en>'+en+'</span><span data-zh hidden>'+zh+'</span>'
def p(en,zh):return '<p>'+b(en,zh)+'</p>'
def eq(tex):return '<span class="equation display" data-math="'+html.escape(tex,quote=True)+'"></span>'
def upsert(file,id,section,before):
 path=R/'web'/file;s=path.read_text();pattern=r'<section\b[^>]*\bid="'+id+r'"[\s\S]*?</section>'
 if re.search(pattern,s):s=re.sub(pattern,lambda _:section,s,count=1)
 else:assert before in s;s=s.replace(before,section+before,1)
 path.write_text(s)
steps=[('Mechanism','机制','Shared directional decisions change weighted flow moments under explicit assumptions.','共同方向决策在明确假设下改变加权成交流的矩。','methods.html#collective-dynamics','Conditional mathematical result','条件数学结果'),('Measurement','测量与反演','Ask what aggregate data identify. Execution amplification is an effective statistic; different microstructures can look the same.','先问宏观数据能识别什么。执行放大是有效统计量，不同微观结构仍可能观测等价。','methods.html#execution-risk-bridge','Assumptions and information counted','注明假设与信息成本'),('Market test','市场检验','Negative Δ rejects the original fixed mechanism as a complete market description. Weighted and dynamic extensions remain testable hypotheses.','负Δ排除原固定机制作为完整市场描述；加权与动态扩展仍是待检验假设。','methods.html#delta','Original restriction retained','保留原限制与反证'),('Risk and use','风险与应用','Map flow to risk, then compare under matched information. Current Bitcoin tests show no extra accuracy or information saving.','将成交流映射到风险，再按相同信息比较；目前Bitcoin检验未显示额外精度或信息节省。','findings.html#information-efficiency','Prediction advantage not established','预测优势尚未建立')]
section='<section class="section wrap research-mainline" id="research-mainline"><h2>'+b('One question from mechanism to evidence','从机制到证据，围绕同一个问题')+'</h2>'+p('Can a small observable description of collective trading support useful risk estimates? Each step below has a distinct evidential job.','能否用少量可观测量描述集体交易，并据此得到有用的风险估计？下面每一步承担不同的证据任务。')+'<ol class="mainline-steps">'
for en,zh,desc,dzh,url,status,szh in steps:section+='<li><h3>'+b(en,zh)+'</h3>'+p(desc,dzh)+'<a href="'+url+'">'+b(status,szh)+'</a></li>'
section+='</ol><div class="mainline-application">'+p('The historical replay follows this line: observe executions, inspect a model-conditional amplification index, then compare the mapped risk scale with realized fluctuation. Its richer execution data make it an explanatory exercise rather than proof of macro-only risk forecasting.','真实回放沿这条线展开：观察成交，检查模型条件下的放大指标，再对照风险映射与已经发生的波动。复盘使用更丰富的成交数据，承担机理讲解功能，不作为仅用宏观量价预测风险的证明。')+'<a class="text-link" href="trading.html">'+b('Play, then inspect the mechanism','先交易，再复盘机理')+'</a></div></section>'
upsert('index.html','research-mainline',section,'<section class="research-intro"')
section='<section class="section reading" id="execution-risk-bridge"><h2>'+b('From observed execution weights to conditional risk','从观测成交权重到条件风险')+'</h2>'+p('Short-horizon prices are modelled through signed trading pressure and the market response. The model studies this trading channel; long-run fundamental value is outside its state variables.','本项目用有方向的交易压力和市场响应刻画短期价格形成，研究这一交易通道；长期基本面价值不在模型状态变量中。')
section+='<h3>'+b('Observe trade sizes; do not assume each fill is a person','先观察成交大小，不把每笔成交当成一个人')+'</h3>'+eq(r'F_t=\sum_i\epsilon_{it}v_{it},\qquad B_t=\sum_i v_{it}^2')+p('The replay measures F and B from actual aggregate executions. F is aggressor-side volume imbalance, not net position ownership or money entering a market without a counterparty. Conditional on execution sizes, independent symmetric signs imply E[F² | sizes]=B. With grouped or dependent actions, cross terms enter. An aggregate execution is not a verified participant or a complete parent order.','回放从真实聚合成交测量F与B；F是主动买卖量不平衡，不是净持仓或脱离对手盘的资金流入。给定成交大小，独立对称方向意味着E[F²|大小]=B；成组或相关方向会引入交叉项。聚合成交并非已确认的参与者，也不是完整母单。')
section+='<h3>'+b('Use a conditional amplification index','使用有条件解释的放大指标')+'</h3>'+eq(r'\widehat G_t=\frac{\widehat{\operatorname{Var}}_{15}(F)}{\overline B_{15}}')+p('Centring separates flow dispersion from its average direction. G measures dispersion relative to the independent-size baseline. Its interpretation as group susceptibility additionally requires the participant/execution map, sign symmetry and mark assumptions. Splitting or size–direction dependence can produce similar observations.','中心化把成交流离散程度与平均方向分开。G比较成交流离散程度与独立大小基线；若要解释成群体易感性，还需要参与者与执行单位的对应、方向对称与大小标记等假设。拆单及大小与方向的依赖也可能产生相似观测。')
section+=eq(r'\overline B_{15}\widehat G_t=\widehat{\operatorname{Var}}_{15}(F)')+p('This cancellation is exact. Naming the factors activity and amplification creates no extra information. A useful forecasting mechanism must supply a successful persistence/transition restriction, cheaper measurement, or additional accuracy at matched inputs.','这一抵消严格成立。把因子命名为活动与放大不会增加信息。机制要对预测有用，必须提供有效的持续性或转移约束、更低测量成本，或在相同输入下更高的精度。')
section+='<h3>'+b('Map flow moments through a price response','通过价格响应映射成交流矩')+'</h3>'+eq(r'r_t=\alpha+\beta F_t+\eta_t,\qquad\beta\geq0')+eq(r'\widehat h_{t+1|t}=(\alpha+\beta\overline F_{15})^2+\beta^2\overline B_3\widehat G_t+\sigma_\eta^2')+p('The local replay fits the response only on 30 completed minutes before play. Coefficients remain fixed; three-minute activity is combined with 15-minute amplification. The map assumes stable response, suitable residual moments and persistence of the estimated flow structure into the next minute. It is a teaching-scale version of the fast-activity/slow-amplification hypothesis, not the daily benchmark model.','局部回放仅用开局前30个已完成分钟校准响应系数，局中固定；将3分钟活动与15分钟放大结合。该映射假设响应稳定、残差矩适当，并将估计的成交流结构延续到下一分钟。这是活动快、放大慢假设的教学时间尺度版本，不是日频基准模型。')
section+=p('The post-round display separates original price and executed flow, model-conditional G and next-minute RMS estimates, observed trailing RMS, and post-hoc navigation markers. Setting G=1 is a model reference with other terms held fixed; it is not a measured causal removal of coordination.','复盘分别标注原始价格与成交流、模型条件下的G及下一分钟RMS估计、实测此前RMS，以及事后定位标记。设G=1是在其余项固定时的模型参照，不是对真实协同进行因果移除的测量。')
section+='<h3>'+b('What the main line has and has not established','这条主线已经建立到哪一步')+'</h3>'+p('The weighted identities and conditional simulation controls are established. Macro identifiability is bounded by observational equivalence. Negative Δ shows that the original fixed assumptions do not jointly describe the market. It does not isolate a single failed assumption: trade-size variation, execution fragmentation and state dependence must be tested separately. Producing the negative sign under a conditional diagnostic does not repair the full joint market law. The coupled fast/slow network and reduced pressure closure are modelling extensions. Matched-budget Bitcoin evaluation establishes no incremental predictive or information-efficiency advantage.','加权恒等式与条件模拟对照已经成立；宏观可识别性受到观测等价约束。负Δ说明原固定假设的组合不能完整描述市场，但单个统计量不定位是哪条假设失效；需要分别检验成交大小、执行碎片化和状态依赖。条件诊断产生负号不等于修复了完整市场联合规律。快慢耦合网络与简化压力闭合式是模型扩展；相同历史预算下的Bitcoin评估尚未显示额外预测或信息效率优势。')
section+=p('Direction switching is allowed by interaction, inertia, adaptation and external orders. A strong side need not win forever, and weak opposition does not automatically attract traders. The current model does not prove an inevitable periodic crash.','相互影响、惯性、适应与外部订单允许方向切换。强方不必永远占优，弱方也不会自动吸引交易者；当前模型没有证明必然发生周期性崩盘。')+'<div class="collective-links"><a href="trading.html">'+b('Inspect the replay debrief','查看真实回放复盘')+'</a><a href="findings.html#information-efficiency">'+b('Read the matched-budget results','查看同预算检验结果')+'</a></div></section>'
upsert('methods.html','execution-risk-bridge',section,'<section class="section reading" id="references"')

path=R/'web/findings.html';s=path.read_text();note='<div class="forecast-mainline-note">'+p('The HAR feature benchmark below is a statistical comparator. The mechanism-derived risk question is evaluated separately under matched information budgets; that comparison currently finds no advantage. Different targets and protocols are not compared by raw score size.','下面的HAR特征基准是统计参照。由机制推导的风险估计另按相同信息预算检验，目前未显示优势；不同目标与协议不按分数绝对大小跨轮比较。')+'<a href="#information-efficiency">'+b('Continue to the mechanism-derived comparison','继续查看机制风险的公平比较')+'</a></div>'
s=re.sub(r'<div class="forecast-mainline-note">[\s\S]*?</div>','',s)
s=re.sub(r'(<section[^>]*id="forecast"[^>]*>)',lambda m:m.group(0)+note,s,count=1);path.write_text(s)
